"""Per-repository template for tools/build_notebook.py (NOTEBOOK_SPEC 2.2 §4 standalone carrier).

Only the task-specific prose and stage cells live here. Runtime install, the embedded pipeline
modules (modeling.py, metrics.py, pipeline.py, samples.py), and the model pin/stage/verify cells are produced
by the generator from repository sources so they cannot drift from the package.

This template configures an E2E change-detection workflow: the pinned CFNet LEVIR-CD checkpoint (a torch pickle
of the state dict) is digest-verified, statically audited and converted once into safetensors, 64 labelled
bi-temporal crops are extracted from the digest-pinned LEVIR-CD tarball, validated and assigned the dataset's own
splits, the frozen model is scored against the all-unchanged baseline, a bounded fine-tuning of the change decoder
runs, the held-out pairs are scored again, change maps are written, and the adapter is exported and reloaded.

Review fixes (Notebook Review Framework v1, review PR #7, CFN-M1..M5 / CFN-m1..m5): the runtime is the fleet's uv
isolated environment (no in-kernel install, no restart); epoch selection uses a deterministic validation loss and
the notebook shows its draw-to-draw noise; every pass of Sections 5-6 starts from the pretrained model; BYOD gets a
real minimum, source ids, member resolution and archive ceilings; and the guided layer (audience, how to use,
roadmap, predictions, worked answers, a change-one-thing activity, troubleshooting, glossary, conclusion) is added.
"""
